#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:4
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:7
msgid "Masonry Scripts"
msgstr "Masonry 脚本"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:9
msgid "The masonry scripts are bundled with VisIt_'s source code. You will need to download the source code and extract masonry from ``visit/src/tools/dev``. There are a few options for downloading the source code. If you want a released version of VisIt_ then go to the `source code downloads page <https://visit.llnl.gov/source>`_ and look for the *VisIt sources* link. The other option is to download from the `git repository <https://github.com/visit-dav/visit>`_. Once you have the source code, copy ``visit/src/tools/dev/masonry`` to a location of your choosing."
msgstr ""
"Masonry 脚本随 VisIt_ 源代码一同提供。你需要下载源代码，并从 ``visit/src/tools/dev`` 中提取 masonry。下载源代码有几种方式：如果你需要 VisIt_ 的发布版本，请访问 `源代码下载页面 <https://visit.llnl.gov/source>`_ 并查找 *VisIt sources* 链接；另一种方式是从 `git 仓库 <https://github.com/visit-dav/visit>`_ 下载。拿到源代码后，将 ``visit/src/tools/dev/masonry`` 复制到你选择的位置。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:17
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:19
msgid "In the ``opts`` directory copy one of the ``*.json`` files and rename it as desired. For example: ``cp mb-3.1.1-darwin-10.14-x86_64-release.json mb-3.1.2-darwin-10.14-x86_64-release.json``"
msgstr ""
"在 ``opts`` 目录中复制一个 ``*.json`` 文件，并按需重命名。例如：``cp mb-3.1.1-darwin-10.14-x86_64-release.json mb-3.1.2-darwin-10.14-x86_64-release.json``"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:22
msgid "Open the JSON configuration file (see :numref:`Figure %s<masonry_config_file>`)  created in **step 1** and modify or add the following options as needed:"
msgstr ""
"打开在 **步骤 1** 中创建的 JSON 配置文件（见 :numref:`Figure %s<masonry_config_file>`），并按需修改或添加以下选项："
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:24
msgid "``arch``: **required**"
msgstr "``arch``：**必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:25
msgid "The build architecture (e.g., darwin-x86_64)."
msgstr "构建架构（例如 darwin-x86_64）。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:27
msgid "``boost_dir``: **optional**"
msgstr "``boost_dir``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:28
msgid "The path to boost if installed on your system. This also triggers the setting of two CMake options (**VISIT_USE_BOOST:BOOL** and **BOOST_ROOT:PATH**)."
msgstr ""
"如果你的系统安装了 boost，请指定其路径。这也会触发设置两个 CMake 选项（**VISIT_USE_BOOST:BOOL** 与 **BOOST_ROOT:PATH**）。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:30
msgid "``branch``: **required**"
msgstr "``branch``：**必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:31
msgid "The git branch to checkout and build."
msgstr "要检出并构建的 git 分支。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:33
msgid "``build_dir``: **optional**"
msgstr "``build_dir``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:34
msgid "The directory to place all of the files generated from the build process. If this option isn't specified the build directory will default to ``build-<json_base>`` (e.g., build-mb-3.1.2-darwin-10.14-x86_64-release) in your current working directory."
msgstr ""
"用于存放构建过程生成的所有文件的目录。如果未指定该选项，构建目录默认位于当前工作目录下的 ``build-<json_base>``（例如 build-mb-3.1.2-darwin-10.14-x86_64-release）。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:36
msgid "``build_types``: **required**"
msgstr "``build_types``：**必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:37
msgid "A list of builds for masonry to create."
msgstr "要让 masonry 创建的构建列表。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:39
msgid "``build_visit``: **required**"
msgstr "``build_visit``：**必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:40
msgid "Allows you to set the ``build_visit`` options."
msgstr "用于设置 ``build_visit`` 的选项。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:42
msgid "``cmake_ver``: **required** - the CMake version to use"
msgstr "``cmake_ver``：**必需** - 要使用的 CMake 版本"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:44
msgid "``args``: **optional** - arguments for ``build_visits``"
msgstr "``args``：**可选** - ``build_visits`` 的参数"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:46
msgid "``libs``: **optional** - third-party libraries to build"
msgstr "``libs``：**可选** - 要构建的第三方库"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:48
msgid "``make_flags``: **optional** - Make flags"
msgstr "``make_flags``：**可选** - Make flags"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:50
msgid "``build_xdb``: **optional**"
msgstr "``build_xdb``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:51
msgid "Set the **VISIT_ENABLE_XDB:BOOL** option to *ON* if true."
msgstr "如果为 true，则将 **VISIT_ENABLE_XDB:BOOL** 设为 *ON*。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:53
msgid "``cert``: **required for signing/notarization**"
msgstr "``cert``：**签名/公证所必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:54
msgid "The Developer ID signing certificate **Common Name**."
msgstr "Developer ID 签名证书的 **Common Name**。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:56
msgid "``cmake_extra_args``: **optional**"
msgstr "``cmake_extra_args``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:57
msgid "Specify extra arguments for CMake."
msgstr "指定额外的 CMake 参数。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:59
msgid "``config_site``: **optional**"
msgstr "``config_site``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:60
msgid "Specify a path for the config site file."
msgstr "指定 config site 文件的路径。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:62
msgid "``cxx_compiler``: **optional**"
msgstr "``cxx_compiler``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:63
msgid "Specify the C++ compiler"
msgstr "指定 C++ 编译器"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:65
msgid "``c_compiler``: **optional**"
msgstr "``c_compiler``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:66
msgid "Specify the C compiler"
msgstr "指定 C 编译器"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:68
msgid "``entitlements``: **required for notarization**"
msgstr "``entitlements``：**公证必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:69
msgid "Specify the location of VisIt's entitlements file. The one used for VisIt releases is located in the ``opts`` directory and is named **visit.entitlements**. See `Hardened Runtime <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/hardened_runtime>`_ for more details on entitlements."
msgstr ""
"指定 VisIt 的 entitlements 文件位置。VisIt 发布版本使用的文件位于 ``opts`` 目录，名为 **visit.entitlements**。关于 entitlements 的更多信息请参见 `Hardened Runtime <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/hardened_runtime>`_。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:71
msgid "``force_clean``: **optional**"
msgstr "``force_clean``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:72
msgid "Removes all files and directories from your build folder."
msgstr "从构建目录中移除所有文件与目录。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:74
msgid "``git``: **required**"
msgstr "``git``：**必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:75
msgid "``mode``: **required** - set this option to **ssh** or **https**"
msgstr "``mode``：**必需** - 将此选项设为 **ssh** 或 **https**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:77
msgid "``git_uname``: **optional** - github username"
msgstr "``git_uname``：**可选** - GitHub 用户名"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:79
msgid "``depth``: **optional** - specify an integer value for a shallow clone with a history truncated to the specified number of commits."
msgstr ""
"``depth``：**可选** - 指定一个整数，用于浅克隆（shallow clone），将历史截断到指定数量的提交。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:81
msgid "``make_nthreads``: **optional**"
msgstr "``make_nthreads``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:82
msgid "The number of parallel threads to use when building the source code."
msgstr "构建源代码时使用的并行线程数。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:84
msgid "``notarize``: **required for notarization**"
msgstr "``notarize``：**公证必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:85
msgid "Specify the options needed for notarization."
msgstr "指定进行公证（notarization）所需的选项。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:87
msgid "``username``: - Apple ID email"
msgstr "``username``：- Apple ID 邮箱"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:89
msgid "``password``: - App-specific password or keychain string containing the App-specific password"
msgstr ""
"``password``：- App 专用密码（App-specific password），或包含该 App 专用密码的钥匙串字符串"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:91
msgid "``asc_provider``: - Provider short name"
msgstr "``asc_provider``：- Provider 短名称"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:93
msgid "``bundle_id``: - VisIt's bundle identifier"
msgstr "``bundle_id``：- VisIt 的 bundle 标识符"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:95
msgid "``platform``: **optional**"
msgstr "``platform``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:96
msgid "Specify the platform (**osx** or **linux**)"
msgstr "指定平台（**osx** 或 **linux**）"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:98
msgid "``skip_checkout``: **optional**"
msgstr "``skip_checkout``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:99
msgid "if you have to restart masonry and already have the source code checked out you can skip that step by setting this option to *yes*."
msgstr ""
"如果你需要重启 masonry 且已经检出了源代码，可以将此选项设为 *yes* 来跳过该步骤。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:101
msgid "``tarball``: **optional**"
msgstr "``tarball``：**可选**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:102
msgid "Specify the path to the source tar file. This option is currently not being used."
msgstr ""
"指定源代码 tar 文件的路径。此选项目前未使用。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:104
msgid "``version``: **required**"
msgstr "``version``：**必需**"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:105
msgid "The version of VisIt you are building."
msgstr "你要构建的 VisIt 版本。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:113
msgid "Masonry's JSON config file"
msgstr "Masonry 的 JSON 配置文件"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:116
msgid "You Might Have to Adjust your PATH"
msgstr "你可能需要调整 PATH"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:118
msgid "There are cases where individual package's configuration processes wind up executing tools in your path (``$PATH``) to help set variables used in compilation. For example, the ``MPICH`` configuration winds up using ``pkg-config``, if it is found in your path, to help set ``CPPFLAGS`` and ``LDFLAGS``. In one case, ``libxml2`` was installed in both ``/opt/local/lib`` and in ``/usr/lib`` but because ``/opt/local/bin`` was first in ``$PATH``, ``/opt/local/bin/pkg-config`` was used to set paths for ``libxml2`` to ``/opt/local/include`` and ``/opt/local/lib``. This results in a build of ``MPICH`` using non-system ``libxml2`` which will fail the ``macOS`` (``otool -L``) ``@rpath`` validation checks on each of the shared libs VisIt is built with later."
msgstr ""
"有时，某些包的配置过程会执行你路径（``$PATH``）中的工具，以帮助设置编译所需的变量。例如，``MPICH`` 的配置可能会在 ``pkg-config`` 存在于 ``$PATH`` 中时使用它来设置 ``CPPFLAGS`` 和 ``LDFLAGS``。曾有一个案例：``libxml2`` 同时安装在 ``/opt/local/lib`` 与 ``/usr/lib`` 中，但由于 ``/opt/local/bin`` 在 ``$PATH`` 中排在前面，配置时使用了 ``/opt/local/bin/pkg-config``，从而把 ``libxml2`` 的路径设置到 ``/opt/local/include`` 和 ``/opt/local/lib``。这会导致 ``MPICH`` 使用非系统的 ``libxml2`` 进行构建，进而在后续对 VisIt 所构建的每个共享库执行 ``macOS``（``otool -L``）的 ``@rpath`` 校验时失败。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:123
msgid "The solution is to be sure your ``$PATH`` variable is set such that nothing *non-standard* can be found in your path prior to running masonry. One way to do this is to ``echo $PATH | tr ':' '\\\\n'`` to display, line-by-line, each path defined in ``$PATH`` and then remove from that list all *non-standard* (for example, anything beginning with ``/opt``) paths ::"
msgstr ""
"解决方法是在运行 masonry 之前，确保 ``$PATH`` 中找不到任何*非标准*路径。一种方法是运行 ``echo $PATH | tr ':' '\\\\n"
"'``，逐行显示 ``$PATH`` 中的每个路径，然后从中移除所有*非标准*路径（例如以 ``/opt`` 开头的路径）::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:129
msgid "Sometimes, it is useful to get tracing information from the masonry scripts. Python has a built in `tracing feature <https://docs.python.org/3/library/trace.html>`__. To use it, invoke the python interpreter with the tracing module like so... ::"
msgstr ""
"有时获取 masonry 脚本的跟踪信息会很有用。Python 内置了 `跟踪功能 <https://docs.python.org/3/library/trace.html>`__。要使用它，可以通过跟踪模块来调用 Python 解释器，例如… ::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:135
msgid "or ::"
msgstr "或 ::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:139
msgid "The first command will result in unbuffered output to the screen and file. The second will buffer the output to the file."
msgstr ""
"第一条命令会将输出不经缓冲地写到屏幕和文件中；第二条命令会将输出缓冲后写入文件。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:143
msgid "What Can Go Wrong?"
msgstr "可能出现哪些问题？"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:145
msgid "Apart from commonly encountered issues building each third party library built by a ``bv_xxx.sh`` script, there are many other ways getting the macOS release ready can fail."
msgstr ""
"除了使用 ``bv_xxx.sh`` 脚本构建各个第三方库时常见的问题之外，让 macOS 发布版本准备就绪还可能在许多其他地方失败。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:147
msgid "There are at least 3 levels of *certifications* (from your macOS keychain) involved."
msgstr ""
"至少涉及 3 个层级的*证书*（来自你的 macOS 钥匙串）。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:149
msgid "The Apple *Root* Certificate Authority (CA) certificates (``Apple Root CA`` or ``Apple Root CA - G2`` or ``Apple Root CA - G3``"
msgstr ""
"Apple *根*证书颁发机构（CA）证书（``Apple Root CA`` 或 ``Apple Root CA - G2`` 或 ``Apple Root CA - G3``）"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:150
msgid "Apple Worldwide Developer Relations Certificate Authority certificates (also called the *intermediate* certificate authority)"
msgstr ""
"Apple Worldwide Developer Relations Certificate Authority 证书（也称为*中间*证书颁发机构）"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:151
msgid "Developer ID Certificate Authority for the organization (Lawrence Livermore) and yourself. These all need to be correctly configured and tied to each other from the lowest level (also called a *leaf* certificate), yourself to the root."
msgstr ""
"组织（Lawrence Livermore）与个人的 Developer ID 证书颁发机构。它们都需要正确配置，并从最低层级（也称为 *leaf* 证书）开始，逐级关联起来，直到根证书。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:154
msgid "Sometimes Apple expires its certificates and you may need to go get `updated certificates. <https://www.apple.com/certificateauthority/>`__"
msgstr ""
"有时 Apple 会让其证书过期，你可能需要获取 `更新后的证书 <https://www.apple.com/certificateauthority/>`__。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:155
msgid "Sometimes your own certificate can expire. Currently, Charles Heizer is the LLNL point of contact for adding developers and updating their expired certificates."
msgstr ""
"有时你自己的证书也可能过期。目前，Charles Heizer 是 LLNL 负责添加开发者与更新其过期证书的联系人。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:157
msgid "You might need to *evaluate* the validity of your certificate using `Apple KeyChain Certificate Assistant <https://support.apple.com/guide/keychain-access/determine-if-a-certificate-is-valid-kyca2794/mac>`__ to confirm its all working."
msgstr ""
"你可能需要使用 `Apple KeyChain Certificate Assistant <https://support.apple.com/guide/keychain-access/determine-if-a-certificate-is-valid-kyca2794/mac>`__ 来*评估*证书有效性，以确认一切正常。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:158
msgid "If you are VPN'd into LLNL, codesigning and notorizing a release may fail."
msgstr "如果你通过 VPN 连接到 LLNL，代码签名与发布版本的公证（notarization）可能会失败。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:159
msgid "If you have MacPorts, Homebrew, Fink or other macOS package managers, python package builds may wind up enabling (and then creating a release that is dependent upon) libraries that are available only to users with similar package managers installed. Worse, you won't have any idea this has happend until you give the release to another developer who has a mac that is not using said package managers and they try to use it and it doesn't work due to missing libraries. You can use ``otool`` combined with ``find`` to try to find any cases where the release has such dependences. For example, the command ::"
msgstr ""
"如果你安装了 MacPorts、Homebrew、Fink 或其他 macOS 包管理器，Python 包的构建过程可能会启用某些库（从而生成一个依赖这些库的发布版本），而这些库仅对安装了类似包管理器的用户可用。更糟的是，你可能直到把发布版本交给一位没有使用这些包管理器的开发者，对方运行时因缺少库而失败，才意识到问题。你可以结合 ``find`` 使用 ``otool`` 来查找发布版本中是否存在这类依赖。例如命令 ::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:166
msgid "will find cases of non-rpath'd library dependencies build into either shared (``.so``) or dynamic (``.dylib``) libraries. Note, however, that sometimes Python EGG's contain Zip-compressed ``.so`` files that this check won't find."
msgstr ""
"会找出在共享库（``.so``）或动态库（``.dylib``）中嵌入了未通过 rpath 处理的库依赖的情况。不过请注意，有时 Python 的 EGG 会包含 Zip 压缩的 ``.so`` 文件，这种检查无法发现。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:169
msgid "Just removing associated stuff from your ``$PATH`` will not prevent these build dependencies. Fixing them likely means finding some of the individual packages in ``bv_python.sh`` and adding ``site.cfg`` files or otherwise finding build switches that explicitly disable the features creating the need for these dependencies."
msgstr ""
"仅仅从 ``$PATH`` 中移除相关内容并不能避免这些构建依赖。修复它们往往意味着需要在 ``bv_python.sh`` 中找到某些具体包，添加 ``site.cfg`` 文件，或通过其他方式找到构建开关来显式禁用导致这些依赖的功能。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:171
msgid "Sometimes, a python package winds up using the python interpreter in ``Xcode`` instead of the one built for the release of VisIt you are preparing. For example, Sphinx can wind up getting installed with all command-line scripts using a `shebang <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shebang_(Unix)>`__ which is an absolute path to ``Xcode``'s python interpreter. We've added patching code to ``bv_python.sh`` to help correct for this."
msgstr ""
"有时，某个 Python 包最终会使用 ``Xcode`` 自带的 Python 解释器，而不是你为准备 VisIt 发布版本所构建的那个。例如，Sphinx 可能会被安装成其所有命令行脚本都使用一个 `shebang <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shebang_(Unix)>`__，该 shebang 是指向 ``Xcode`` 的 Python 解释器的绝对路径。我们已经在 ``bv_python.sh`` 中加入了补丁代码来帮助修正此问题。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:176
msgid "Codesigning, Notarizing and Stapling macOS Builds"
msgstr "macOS 构建的代码签名、公证与贴票（stapling）"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:178
msgid "There are several aspects to producing a ``.dmg`` application bundle for macOS. The most involved of these steps is *codesigning*. Codesigning involves iterating over all the libraries and executables in the bundle and doing so in a bottom-up or inside-out fashion such that the leaves of any dependency chains are codesigned first. Its not a manual process and the masonry scripts involve quite a bit of logic (thanks Kevin Griffin) to get it right. However, the remaining steps involving notarizing and stapling the notarization ticket to the ``.dmg`` bundle can easily be handled manually. The masonry scripts are designed to do these steps automatically as well but they can also be handled manually if necessary. Because Apple seems to change these processes frequently, we capture here some of the key steps."
msgstr ""
"生成 macOS 的 ``.dmg`` 应用包涉及多个方面，其中最复杂的步骤是*代码签名*（codesigning）。代码签名需要遍历包内的所有库与可执行文件，并以自底向上或由内到外的方式进行，以确保依赖链的叶子节点先被签名。这不是手工流程，masonry 脚本中包含了不少逻辑（感谢 Kevin Griffin）来正确完成它。不过，后续的公证（notarization）以及将公证票据贴到 ``.dmg`` 包上的 stapling 步骤，通常可以手动完成。masonry 脚本也被设计为能够自动完成这些步骤，但必要时也可以手动处理。由于 Apple 似乎经常改变这些流程，这里记录一些关键步骤。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:187
msgid "Notarizing"
msgstr "公证（Notarization）"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:189
msgid "Prior to November, 2023, ``xcrun altool`` was used to notarize macOS bundles. This was changed by Apple to use ``xcrun notarytool``. `Migrating <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/technotes/tn3147-migrating-to-the-latest-notarization-tool>`__ from the old approach to the new one is straightforward."
msgstr ""
"在 2023 年 11 月之前，macOS 包的公证使用 ``xcrun altool``。Apple 已改为使用 ``xcrun notarytool``。从旧方式迁移到新方式通常很直接，参见 `Migrating <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/technotes/tn3147-migrating-to-the-latest-notarization-tool>`__。"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:193
msgid "Old way using ``xcrun altool``... ::"
msgstr "使用 ``xcrun altool`` 的旧方式… ::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:197
msgid "New way using ``xcrun notarytool``... ::"
msgstr "使用 ``xcrun notarytool`` 的新方式… ::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:201
msgid "Where ``APPLE_ID`` is your Apple Id login with Apple, ``APP_PASSWORD`` is the clear-text name for the `app-specific password <https://support.apple.com/en-us/102654>`__ you created (once probably in the distant past and you can no longer remember the steps involved) in your keychain and ``TEAM_ID`` is the Apple Developer ID for LLNL. For the ``APP_PASSWORD`` to work correctly with ``notarytool``, you will need to `copy over <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/technotes/tn3147-migrating-to-the-latest-notarization-tool#Save-credentials-in-the-keychain>`__ the app-specific password you were using for ``altool`` so that it can also be used for ``notarytool``."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``APPLE_ID`` 是你用于登录 Apple 的 Apple ID，``APP_PASSWORD`` 是你在钥匙串中创建的 `App 专用密码 <https://support.apple.com/en-us/102654>`__ 的明文名称（可能很久以前创建的，你已经记不清具体步骤），``TEAM_ID`` 是 LLNL 的 Apple Developer ID。为了让 ``APP_PASSWORD`` 能在 ``notarytool`` 中正常工作，你需要将原来用于 ``altool`` 的 App 专用密码 `复制过来 <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/technotes/tn3147-migrating-to-the-latest-notarization-tool#Save-credentials-in-the-keychain>`__，以便它也能被 ``notarytool`` 使用。"
