msgstr ""
"你可以通过挂载 ``.dmg`` 文件并运行以下命令来检查 ``VisIt.app`` 是否已正确进行代码签名 ::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:250
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:259
msgid "which should produce output like so... ::"
msgstr "其输出应类似如下… ::"
