msgid "You can check whether ``VisIt.app`` is properly notarized using this command ::"
msgstr "你可以用以下命令检查 ``VisIt.app`` 是否已正确公证 ::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:265
msgid "You can get more details about why a notorization failed using the command ::"
msgstr "你可以用以下命令获取公证失败原因的更多细节 ::"
#: building_visit/BuildingOnMac/Setup.rst:269
msgid "where ``SUBMISSION_ID`` is the id you get (printed by masonry to the logs) in the ``id:`` field of the details returned from ``xcrun notarytool submit`` command. And, this should produce a lot of output like so... ::"
